Register the complete dependency graph in `MauiProgram.CreateMauiApp()`:

```csharp
builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDataService, DataService>();
builder.Services.AddTransient<DetailViewModel>();
builder.Services.AddTransient<DetailPage>();
```

Register the route once when the shell is constructed:

```csharp
public AppShell()
{
    InitializeComponent();
    Routing.RegisterRoute("details", typeof(DetailPage));
}
```

Constructor injection then flows through the view model and page:

```csharp
public sealed class DetailViewModel
{
    private readonly IDataService _data;
    public DetailViewModel(IDataService data) => _data = data;
}

public partial class DetailPage : ContentPage
{
    public DetailPage(DetailViewModel viewModel)
    {
        InitializeComponent();
        BindingContext = viewModel;
    }
}
```

Navigate through the registered route and await completion:

```csharp
await Shell.Current.GoToAsync("details");
```
